<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-954] Cannot select data from table</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-954</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After the recent move to Handsontable, I am not able to select any data from the table. In the demo at &lt;a href=&quot;https://handsontable.com/examples.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://handsontable.com/examples.html&lt;/a&gt;, it allows us to select data from the table. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
